OL,3,GNEWSAProbe after dead puppies found in
OL,4,Afield
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police investigation is under way
OL,7,Fafter several deceased puppies were
OL,8,Ffound in a field in Detling.
OL,10,FA member of the public discovered the
OL,11,Fremains near Detling Community Store
OL,12,Fand Post Office in Pilgrims Way at
OL,13,Fabout 15:00 BST on 10 August.
OL,15,FKent Police said officers attended the
OL,16,Fscene and later found several more
OL,17,Fshallow burial sites in the same field.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
