OL,3,GNEWSAProbe after dead puppies found in
OL,4,Afield
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Insp Tristan Stevens said: "This is
OL,7,Fa deeply upsetting incident and
OL,8,Finvestigators are working with partner
OL,9,Fagencies to establish what happened to
OL,10,Fthe animals and how they arrived at the
OL,11,Fsite."
